  - m_Id: 6903966347845672
    m_Localized: "Anonymous \nCarved and polychrome wooden sculpture \n18th Century
      \nHoused within a carved urn.\nNational Museum Collection, Ministry of Education,
      Sports, and Culture"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6903966347845673
    m_Localized: 'Bell Tower and Clock '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6903966347845674
    m_Localized: "The upper central section of the building was constructed in 1865
      under Garc\xEDa Moreno. The clock and its bells were installed during the presidency
      of Jer\xF3nimo Carri\xF3n (1865\u20131867). \nThe national flag flies from
      the highest point of the palace. \nIn 2025, under the administration of President
      Daniel Noboa, the palace clock was restored to operation after having been
      stopped for some time."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
