  - m_Id: 71228744445468672
    m_Localized: Entrar al Salon Azul
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74657426526707712
    m_Localized: Blue Hall
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57855467520
    m_Localized: 'This is the Palace of Carondelet. It has been here for hundreds
      of years and houses the memory of the Republic of Ecuador from its independence
      to the present day.

      Are you curious that it bears my name? Move the
      building and access the interactive points to learn more about this emblematic
      structure. Alternatively, click the "Enter" button to explore further.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57956130816
    m_Localized: We've rolled out the red carpet for your honorable visit. Everything
      is ready for you to explore the history and memory of this, one of the most
      important buildings in Ecuador. At the beginning of the 17th century, the Royal
      Audience was already operating in this space. That's when I arrived here, and
      since then, many things have happened. Now you can find out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 106562793053364225
    m_Localized: 'You have reached this point, one of the most important parts of
      the palace and of this virtual tour. To continue, you must bow to the National
      Flag. Look in front of you and head toward the flag.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 106562793053364230
    m_Localized: A new space to explore. This is the famous Hall of Presidents. It
      was inaugurated in 1960 and is known as the Golden Hall because of the French
      tapestry that covers its walls. Formal events such as the inaugurations of
      ministers or the signing of decrees are held here, and it shows the portraits
      of Ecuador's Presidents. Look for the icon to view them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
